# Require the repository owner's review for the build-config injection guard and
# every surface it scans or executes from, so a change cannot weaken the guard
# and land in the same unreviewed merge it would otherwise let through.
#
# This file is a prerequisite only: GitHub applies CODEOWNERS review requests
# once a repository administrator enables a branch ruleset / branch protection
# that requires code-owner review. Until then it still routes every change here
# to the owner as a requested reviewer.
/scripts/  @Giftobafaiye
/.github/  @Giftobafaiye
